{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotent-pricing","title":"算价幂等与下单价一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/pricing-pipeline/idempotent-pricing","wordCount":2070,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"算价幂等与下单价一致\">算价幂等与下单价一致</h1><p>最伤用户的一类 bug 长这样：结算页显示&quot;实付 168 元&quot;，点击提交后订单变成 182 元，或者更糟——同一单被提交了两次，两次的优惠还不一样。这类问题的根源是&quot;算价&quot;与&quot;下单&quot;之间隔着一段时间、一次网络、一个并发世界，而活动可能在这段时间里变了。本篇讲怎么让&quot;用户看到的价&quot;与&quot;订单落库的价&quot;在数学上必然相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>&quot;算价幂等&quot;这个词包含两个不同强度的承诺，必须分清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承诺</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>重试幂等</strong></td>\n<td>同一请求重放 N 次，结果相同</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>时刻一致</strong></td>\n<td>结算页的价 = 下单成功的价，即使跨了若干秒</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>可重放</strong></td>\n<td>用订单上的快照 + 版本，能在事后精确重算出当时的价</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>只做到第一个是不够的。用户点了&quot;提交订单&quot;但网络超时，客户端重试——如果这期间活动结束或预算耗尽，两次算价结果就不同。所以要靠<strong>价格快照 + 版本校验 + 幂等键</strong>三者组合，把三个承诺都兜住。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C as 客户端&#10;  participant P as 算价服务&#10;  participant O as 订单服务&#10;  participant DB as 订单库&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;P: 试算(带 cartHash)&#10;  P-&gt;&gt;P: 跑流水线(version=V42)&#10;  P--&gt;&gt;C: 实付168 + priceToken(V42, cartHash)&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;O: 提交订单(priceToken)&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;DB: 校验幂等键&#10;  alt 幂等键已存在&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;O: 返回已有订单&#10;  else 新订单&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;P: 校验token有效性(version仍在有效窗口)&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;O: 有效&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;DB: 落库(价格快照 + version=V42)&#10;  end&#10;  O--&gt;&gt;C: 订单号\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as 客户端\n  participant P as 算价服务\n  participant O as 订单服务\n  participant DB as 订单库\n  C-&gt;&gt;P: 试算(带 cartHash)\n  P-&gt;&gt;P: 跑流水线(version=V42)\n  P--&gt;&gt;C: 实付168 + priceToken(V42, cartHash)\n  C-&gt;&gt;O: 提交订单(priceToken)\n  O-&gt;&gt;DB: 校验幂等键\n  alt 幂等键已存在\n    DB--&gt;&gt;O: 返回已有订单\n  else 新订单\n    O-&gt;&gt;P: 校验token有效性(version仍在有效窗口)\n    P--&gt;&gt;O: 有效\n    O-&gt;&gt;DB: 落库(价格快照 + version=V42)\n  end\n  O--&gt;&gt;C: 订单号</pre><h2 id=\"价格快照-把-怎么算的-一起存下来\">价格快照：把&quot;怎么算的&quot;一起存下来</h2><p>只存最终实付额是不够的——你无法解释它、无法退款分摊、无法审计。正确的做法是把算价输出结构 <code>PriceBreakdown</code>（见<a href=\"pricing-stages\">商品价→活动→券→实付的阶段</a>）整体作为快照落库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PriceSnapshot {&#10;  version: string; // 规则快照版本&#10;  cartHash: string; // 购物车指纹&#10;  breakdown: PriceBreakdown; // 完整明细（行级 + 订单级 + trace）&#10;  appliedPromotions: Array&lt;{ id: string; deduction: Money; group?: string }&gt;;&#10;  appliedCoupons: Array&lt;{ instanceId: string; deduction: Money }&gt;;&#10;  computedAt: Date;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriceSnapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 规则快照版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cartHash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 购物车指纹</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  breakdown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriceBreakdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 完整明细（行级 + 订单级 + trace）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  appliedPromotions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">group</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  appliedCoupons</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instanceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  computedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cartHash</code> 是购物车内容的指纹（sku×qty×地址×选择的券，排序后哈希），它的作用是<strong>一致性的第一道闸</strong>：下单请求若带着和试算时不同的 <code>cartHash</code>，服务端直接拒绝并提示重新试算，而不是试图&quot;在不一致的基础上算出一个价&quot;。这一条把大量边界情况扼杀在入口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function checkConsistency(token: PriceToken, req: SubmitOrderReq): void {&#10;  if (token.cartHash !== hashCart(req.cart)) {&#10;    throw new PriceChangedError(&#39;CART_CHANGED&#39;); // 购物车变了&#10;  }&#10;  if (token.expiredAt &lt; req.now) {&#10;    throw new PriceChangedError(&#39;TOKEN_EXPIRED&#39;); // 试算凭证过期&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkConsistency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriceToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubmitOrderReq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (token.cartHash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hashCart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.cart)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriceChangedError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CART_CHANGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 购物车变了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (token.expiredAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.now) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriceChangedError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TOKEN_EXPIRED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 试算凭证过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>priceToken</code> 一般是一个签名过的短凭证（含 <code>version</code>、<code>cartHash</code>、<code>expiredAt</code>、<code>userId</code>），有效期几分钟。它不加密价格（价格从服务端再算一次拿），只承载&quot;这次试算是基于什么&quot;这几个字段。签名防止篡改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本校验-规则变了怎么办\">版本校验：规则变了怎么办</h2><p>关键问题是：试算用的 <code>V42</code> 快照，在用户提交时可能已经变成 <code>V43</code>。此时有三种策略，选择取决于业务对&quot;价格突然变化&quot;的容忍度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>严格一致</strong></td>\n<td>必须与 token 的 version 相同，否则拒绝下单</td>\n<td>高客单、价格敏感商品</td>\n<td>大促时规则频繁上线 → 拒单率高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>宽容窗口</strong></td>\n<td>允许 version 在 token 后 N 分钟内变更，仍按旧版下单</td>\n<td>一般场景</td>\n<td>可能少收/多减一点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>以新为准</strong></td>\n<td>用最新 version 重算，价格变了就提示用户确认</td>\n<td>C 端常规</td>\n<td>体验略差，但最安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主流做法是<strong>宽容窗口</strong>：活动规则发布时强制&quot;变更需提前生效时间&quot;（比如提前 5 分钟下发），使刚试算的 token 在有效期内不会撞上版本切换；再叠加&quot;偏差超过阈值则要求用户确认&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>payable</mtext><mtext>token</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>payable</mtext><mtext>latest</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>直接下单</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>否则</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>要求确认</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\text{payable}_{\\text{token}} - \\text{payable}_{\\text{latest}}| \\le \\epsilon \\Rightarrow \\text{直接下单},\\quad \\text{否则} \\Rightarrow \\text{要求确认}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">token</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">latest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">直接下单</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否则</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">要求确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 通常是 0 或很小的值（如 0.01 元）。这里有一条业务判断：<strong>价格变低时应当放行</strong>（对用户有利），把拒绝策略留给&quot;变高&quot;的情况。这既符合直觉，也避免用户投诉&quot;明明降价了却不让我下单&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等键-同一次提交只产生一单\">幂等键：同一次提交只产生一单</h2><p>跨秒的一致性解决了&quot;价格会不会变&quot;，幂等键解决&quot;会不会重复下单&quot;。幂等键的设计要点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface IdempotencyRecord {&#10;  key: string; // 幂等键&#10;  state: &#39;PROCESSING&#39; | &#39;SUCCEEDED&#39; | &#39;FAILED&#39;;&#10;  orderId?: string; // 成功后的订单号&#10;  requestHash: string; // 请求体指纹&#10;  expireAt: Date;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IdempotencyRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 幂等键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PROCESSING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SUCCEEDED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 成功后的订单号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requestHash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 请求体指纹</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expireAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条实现规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>键的构造必须包含用户与业务语义</strong>：<code>${userId}:${clientOrderToken}</code>，其中 <code>clientOrderToken</code> 由客户端在进入结算页时生成一次并全程复用。绝不能用&quot;随机 UUID 每次请求新生成&quot;——那样重试就是新请求。也绝不能用&quot;购物车内容哈希&quot;——用户故意下两单相同商品是合法的。这条&quot;客户端生成一个唯一键、重试时复用同一个键&quot;的做法正是 Stripe 的幂等请求约定：<code>Idempotency-Key</code> 由客户端生成，服务端对同一个键只执行一次并缓存首次结果返回给后续重试；Stripe 还限制键长不超过 255 字符、并会在键产生 24 小时后自动清理（来源：Stripe API 官方文档 Idempotent requests，<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests\">https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests</a> ）。HTTP 层面也已有一条对应的标准草案字段 <code>Idempotency-Key</code>，用于让 POST/PATCH 这类非幂等方法具备容错重试能力（来源：IETF HTTPAPI WG draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header，<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/</a> ）。</li>\n<li><strong><code>PROCESSING</code> 状态的重复请求要等待而不是重跑</strong>：第二个同键请求发现记录是 <code>PROCESSING</code>，应当轮询等待第一个完成，然后返回同一个结果。直接重跑会导致两次扣券、两次扣库存。</li>\n<li><strong><code>requestHash</code> 校验</strong>：同键但请求体不同（用户改了地址又提交），说明是不同意图，应当拒绝并提示，而不是复用旧订单。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function submitOrder(req: SubmitOrderReq): Promise&lt;Order&gt; {&#10;  const key = `${req.userId}:${req.clientOrderToken}`;&#10;  const got = await idemStore.getOrReserve(key, hash(req));&#10;  if (got.state === &#39;SUCCEEDED&#39;) return loadOrder(got.orderId!);&#10;  if (got.state === &#39;PROCESSING&#39;) return await waitForOrder(key);&#10;  try {&#10;    const order = await doCreateOrder(req); // 真正下单&#10;    await idemStore.markSucceeded(key, order.id);&#10;    return order;&#10;  } catch (e) {&#10;    await idemStore.markFailed(key);&#10;    throw e;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> submitOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubmitOrderReq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">req</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">req</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clientOrderToken</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> got</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idemStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getOrReserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (got.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SUCCEEDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(got.orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (got.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PROCESSING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> doCreateOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 真正下单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idemStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">markSucceeded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, order.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idemStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">markFailed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>幂等键的存储必须是<strong>原子</strong>的 <code>getOrReserve</code>——用 Redis 的 <code>SET NX</code>（&quot;仅当 key 不存在时才设置&quot;，返回 nil 表示已被占用）或数据库唯一索引（唯一约束在插入重复键时直接报错，因此&quot;第一条成功、重试被拒&quot;天然成立）。用&quot;先查后写&quot;的朴素逻辑在并发下会漏（来源：Redis SET 命令 NX 选项与 PostgreSQL 唯一约束语义，<a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/set/\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/set/</a> 、<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-constraints.html\">https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-constraints.html</a> ）。这套机制与 <code>58/05</code> 幂等、重试与补偿讲的是同一套手法，本 hub 的差异在于：这里的幂等键还绑定着<strong>一张券实例</strong>，所以还要防&quot;同一张券被两个订单用掉&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"券与预算的幂等-真正的难点\">券与预算的幂等：真正的难点</h2><p>价格可以重算，但券一旦被用掉就是一种<strong>资源状态变更</strong>，不可逆。所以下单链路里有一个严格的顺序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[校验 priceToken 一致性] --&gt; B[校验券实例状态 UNUSED]&#10;  B --&gt; C[原子锁定券实例 → LOCKED]&#10;  C --&gt;|锁定失败| X[返回券已被使用]&#10;  C --&gt;|成功| D[扣减活动预算]&#10;  D --&gt;|预算不足| Y[回滚券锁定 → 失败]&#10;  D --&gt; E[创建订单 落价格快照]&#10;  E --&gt; F[券实例 → USED 并绑定 orderId]&#10;  F --&gt; G[异步扣库存/通知]\">graph TD\n  A[校验 priceToken 一致性] --&gt; B[校验券实例状态 UNUSED]\n  B --&gt; C[原子锁定券实例 → LOCKED]\n  C --&gt;|锁定失败| X[返回券已被使用]\n  C --&gt;|成功| D[扣减活动预算]\n  D --&gt;|预算不足| Y[回滚券锁定 → 失败]\n  D --&gt; E[创建订单 落价格快照]\n  E --&gt; F[券实例 → USED 并绑定 orderId]\n  F --&gt; G[异步扣库存/通知]</pre><p>每一步失败都要能回滚到上一步，并且这些回滚本身也要幂等（见<a href=\"../budget-coupon/coupon-lifecycle\">券生命周期、核销与退款回退</a>）。券状态的原子流转（<code>UNUSED → LOCKED → USED</code>）用一条带条件的更新完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE coupon_instance&#10;   SET status = &#39;LOCKED&#39;, locked_by = ?, locked_at = ?&#10; WHERE instance_id = ? AND status = &#39;UNUSED&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, locked_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?, locked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNUSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>受影响行数为 0 就说明已被别人锁走。这是&quot;用数据库的原子性代替分布式锁&quot;的典型做法，比先查后改可靠得多——<code>UPDATE</code> 的返回值就是被真正改动的行数，条件写在 <code>WHERE</code> 里由数据库保证判断与写在同一个原子操作内（来源：MySQL 8.0 官方手册 UPDATE 语句 &quot;returns the number of rows that were actually changed&quot;，<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/update.html\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/update.html</a> ）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性自检-把差异变成可观测指标\">一致性自检：把差异变成可观测指标</h2><p>即使做了以上全部，线上仍会出现&quot;试算价 ≠ 下单价&quot;的个案（多半来自版本切换的时间窗、或客户端缓存了旧的 token）。正确的态度不是假设它不会发生，而是<strong>度量它</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>price_mismatch_rate</code></td>\n<td>提交时重算与 token 价格不同的比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>token_expired_rate</code></td>\n<td>因 token 过期被拒的比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version_drift_count</code></td>\n<td>提交时 version 与试算 version 不同的次数</td>\n<td>突增告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>idem_conflict_rate</code></td>\n<td>幂等键冲突（重复提交）比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 1%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些指标同时是排查线索：<code>version_drift_count</code> 突增往往意味着有人在高频改活动规则；<code>token_expired_rate</code> 升高通常指向客户端结算页停留时间过长或 token TTL 设得太短。指标的采集与归因方式的完整讨论见<a href=\"../performance-safety/promotion-observability\">促销效果归因与预算监控</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;算价幂等&quot;有三个强度：重试幂等、<strong>时刻一致</strong>、<strong>可重放</strong>；只做第一个会在大促时暴露问题。</li>\n<li>落库要存<strong>完整价格快照</strong>（<code>PriceBreakdown</code> + <code>version</code> + <code>cartHash</code>），而非只存实付额。</li>\n<li><code>cartHash</code> 是一致性第一道闸：购物车变了就拒绝下单并要求重新试算，不去&quot;猜&quot;。</li>\n<li>版本变化用<strong>宽容窗口</strong>策略：允许 token 有效期内按旧版下单，价格变小放行、变大要求确认。</li>\n<li>幂等键 = <code>${userId}:${clientOrderToken}</code>，用原子 <code>getOrReserve</code> + <code>requestHash</code> 校验，<code>PROCESSING</code> 状态重复请求要等待而非重跑。</li>\n<li>券状态用带条件的原子更新流转 <code>UNUSED → LOCKED → USED</code>；失败逐级回滚且回滚本身也要幂等。</li>\n<li>把 <code>price_mismatch_rate</code>、<code>version_drift_count</code> 等差异指标做成监控，而不是假设差异不会发生。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"算价幂等与下单价一致","id":"算价幂等与下单价一致"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价格快照：把\"怎么算的\"一起存下来","id":"价格快照-把-怎么算的-一起存下来"},{"level":2,"text":"版本校验：规则变了怎么办","id":"版本校验-规则变了怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等键：同一次提交只产生一单","id":"幂等键-同一次提交只产生一单"},{"level":2,"text":"券与预算的幂等：真正的难点","id":"券与预算的幂等-真正的难点"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性自检：把差异变成可观测指标","id":"一致性自检-把差异变成可观测指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多券最优组合求解与剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/pricing-pipeline/best-combo-solver"},"next":{"title":"券预算原子扣减与超发防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/budget-coupon/coupon-budget-control"}}